# Build output. Every project builds into its own bin/ and obj/; publish and bundle output goes to
# artifacts/, which build.sh and build.cmd create.
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
publish/
*.binlog

# Test output: rendered PNGs, TestResults, coverage. The PNGs are for review, not for history.
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage*.xml

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/

# IDEs and editors. Per-user state only; shared settings (.editorconfig) live at the root.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.openidea/
*.user
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user
*.swp
*~

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# The specification and the icon generator stay with the owner, outside the repository, in specs/ (its own
# git repository). CLAUDE.local.md imports specs/CLAUDE.md for Claude Code; .claude/ holds its settings.
specs/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# MindBuzz documents created while trying the app out in the working tree, and their recovery files. Test fixtures, if any are ever committed, go under tests/ and are force-added.
/*.mbz
.*.mbz~
